$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475089200_592893470067142803_562534348863138448", {"feature":"592893470067142803","feature2":"562534348863138448","owner":"103582791475089200","commentthreadid":"638835716","total_count":4,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":1889366416,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":1826420,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"562534348863158592":{"text":"nah its not you, they will literally wipe out in sync and get a top score for chase.\nI even get a nudge into the wall and then ai will plow through like im  now invisible....... and i get DQ\nor watch the replay and see points get deducted for off track and im perfectly on the line\nor im chasing and AI will clearly miiss clips and still score more than me\n\nits a terrible win lose system, its not luck or skill its purely programmed","author":"Liki_YouKnowIt?"},"562534348863158955":{"text":"easy for AI to score big on a chase when we have a nice steady lead. Then it has a shit lead and makes it difficult to chase so it wins again","author":"Liki_YouKnowIt?"},"573801622447220803":{"text":"I cant get past the first levels after the drift school I\u2019ll get a score in the mid 80s and the ai will get 95-100","author":"desertstorm1912"},"568175240219401770":{"text":"As others said, career mode is a complete disaster. I tried it and it's really impossible to progress. The AI gets too good even that they scored big when I become the chaser. It's best to do free ride for now.","author":"AutisticPinoy989"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
