			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_562534348863158592">
				nah its not you, they will literally wipe out in sync and get a top score for chase.<br>I even get a nudge into the wall and then ai will plow through like im  now invisible....... and i get DQ<br>or watch the replay and see points get deducted for off track and im perfectly on the line<br>or im chasing and AI will clearly miiss clips and still score more than me<br><br>its a terrible win lose system, its not luck or skill its purely programmed			</div>
